---
description: Public JS SDK API boundaries
globs:
  - "packages/*/src/index.ts"
  - "packages/nextjs/src/**/index.ts"
---

# Public API

- `@newtalaria/core` is not a documented install target
- `@newtalaria/react` and `@newtalaria/nextjs` re-export their runtime
- Next.js consumers import `/client`, `/server`, `/edge`, `/config` — never mix Node `http` into the client graph
- Additive APIs only on `@newtalaria/browser` (Silverstripe CDN pin)
- Tracing default off
